// Copy for guide-new-build-prices-costa-del-sol.html, the page of new-build "from" prices by area.
//
// Two kinds of text live here, because the page has two kinds of text:
//
//  * GUIDE_PRICES_ENTRIES -- the page frame (title, description, kicker, hero). The hub card's
//    three strings are in guide_card_translations.mjs with the other hub cards.
//    Literal find/replace entries, the same contract as every other guide table; the
//    footer-page builder applies them after rendering.
//
//  * GUIDE_PRICES_COPY -- the body. It is NOT find/replace, because the body carries figures
//    read from the project files and a find string cannot contain a number that changes. The
//    renderer (guide_prices_data.mjs) fills the {placeholders} and formats every price, quarter
//    and area name itself. English is the source; the nine overlays follow the settled
//    terminology in translation-review/<locale>/review-notes.md ("starting price" is
//    Precio desde / Prix à partir de / Preis ab / Цена от / السعر ابتداءً من / Prijs vanaf /
//    Cena od / Pris från / Pris fra).
//
// Counts are never put in front of a noun in running prose (Russian, Polish and Arabic decline
// the noun by the number, and the number changes with the data): they sit in labelled cells.
